      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día hubo una gran reunión de sabios y dioses.",
          "en": "One day, there was a great gathering of sages and gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando entró Daksha, todos se pusieron de pie para honrarlo. Todos menos Brahma y Shiva.",
          "en": "When Daksha came in, everyone stood up to honor him. Everyone except Brahma and Shiva."
        },
        {
          "es": "Brahma era su padre, así que estaba bien. Pero Shiva era su yerno.",
          "en": "Brahma was his father, so that was fine. But Shiva was his son-in-law."
        },
        {
          "es": "Daksha se sintió insultado. Delante de todos, maldijo a Shiva: nunca más tendría su parte en los sacrificios.",
          "en": "Daksha felt insulted. In front of everyone, he cursed Shiva: he would never again get a share of the sacrifices."
        },
        {
          "es": "Shiva no dijo nada. Se quedó tranquilo, y simplemente se fue.",
          "en": "Shiva said nothing. He stayed calm, and simply walked away."
        }
      ],
