      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Desde el Kailash, Sati vio pasar volando a los dioses, todos camino al sacrificio de su padre.",
          "en": "From Kailash, Sati saw the gods flying past, all on their way to her father's sacrifice."
        },
        {
          "es": "Quería ir. Allí estarán mi madre y mis hermanas, le dijo a Shiva. Vamos juntos.",
          "en": "She wanted to go. My mother and sisters will be there, she told Shiva. Let's go together."
        },
        {
          "es": "Shiva le advirtió con dulzura: tu padre me odia. Si vas, te va a insultar.",
          "en": "Shiva warned her gently: your father hates me. If you go, he will insult you."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sati no pudo quedarse. Fue de todos modos, con Nandi, el toro blanco, y los compañeros de Shiva.",
          "en": "Sati could not stay. She went anyway, with Nandi, the white bull, and with Shiva’s companions."
        }
