          "en": "No one dared to welcome her, except her mother and her sisters, who hugged her in tears."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Sati miró el altar. No había ninguna parte de las ofrendas para Shiva.",
          "en": "Then Sati looked at the altar. There was no share of the offerings for Shiva."
